# impeccable-ignore-start
# Policy and preservation: docs/agents/impeccable-artifacts.md.
# Keep only the shared inputs; ** also covers nested workspaces.
**/.impeccable/**
!**/.impeccable/config.json
!**/.impeccable/design.json
!**/.impeccable/live/
**/.impeccable/live/**
!**/.impeccable/live/config.json
# Runtime layouts still read by the installed Impeccable.
**/.impeccable-live/
**/.impeccable-live.json
# impeccable-ignore-end

# Local task cache and disposable Worker bundles
**/.turbo/
/apps/www-origin/dist/
/apps/api-worker/dist/

/tests/e2e/test-results/
/tests/e2e/playwright-report/
/tests/e2e/blob-report/
.dev.vars
/dist/
/.vinext/
/.wrangler/

